# Final System - Grep
# Build and install under chroot

# First, remove a warning about using 
# egrep and fgrep that makes tests on 
# some packages fail: 
sed -i "s/echo/#echo/" src/egrep.sh

# Prepare grep for 64-bit compilation: 
./configure --prefix=/usr

# Compile the package:
make 

# To test the results, issue: 
make check

# Install the package: 
make install
